  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Two RPCs, one queue",
      "items": [
        "A reply is send_text, a 350 ms settle, then send_keys — never interleaved",
        "Each pane owns a promise chain; a 10 s wait throws PaneBusyError and answers 503",
        "If the text lands but the key fails, textDelivered: true tells the phone not to resend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Events are only a poke",
      "items": [
        "EventPoker debounces every Herdr event 200 ms into engine.pokeNow()",
        "The session.snapshot poll is the source of truth; a missed event costs one interval",
        "A healthy stream relaxes SIGHTR_POLL_MS to SIGHTR_POLL_IDLE_MS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Back on the phone",
      "items": [
        "applySnapshot updates the herd; with no pane open the frame also revalidates loaders",
        "With a pane open the 1.5 s timer still runs — pane text comes from /api/pane/:id",
        "Every write appends one JSON line to <state-dir>/audit.log with the device id"
      ]
    }
  ]
